// Software-factory template — OpenCode config.
//
// This file exists so vibr8's OpenCodeProjectAdapter yields ownership of
// the model pin to the template. Without it, the adapter injects
// OPENCODE_DEFAULT_MODEL = openai/gpt-5.2-codex to avoid OpenCode's default
// model resolution landing on a tool-incompatible model. Same intent here,
// declared explicitly.
//
// Per-agent configuration is NOT required — the agent files under agents/
// declare their own mode + tools frontmatter and OpenCode discovers them
// via the OPENCODE_CONFIG_DIR walk that the adapter sets to .opencode/.
{
  "$schema": "https://opencode.ai/config.json",
  "model": "openai/gpt-5.2-codex"
}
